@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}
<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>

<p>
    VideoSecurity records playback sessions, progress, entitlement grants, and security events
    needed to protect paid or private video content. Raw IP addresses and user-agent strings are
    not stored; they are converted to keyed HMAC hashes before persistence.
</p>
<p>
    The visible watermark identifies the signed-in user and playback session so redistributed
    recordings can be traced. Security telemetry may include visibility changes, focus loss,
    heartbeat timing, and best-effort tamper signals. Old security events are pruned by the
    background cleanup service after the configured retention window.
</p>
